{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/3ca0dc03be1360e2ac905799c58bd28c.poster.avif?t=1774324615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/3ca0dc03be1360e2ac905799c58bd28c.webm?t=1774324615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/3ca0dc03be1360e2ac905799c58bd28c.mp4?t=1774324615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Six Sides Under </strong>is a chaotic, fast-paced twin stick shooter roguelite where you play as a living die rebelling against the rules of classic board games. Roll, dash, and shoot your way through boards packed with traps, bosses, and deadly game pieces. Every move is a gamble, every roll could be your last, and only the clever and daring will survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/f1a1024310ffbdd0709c151ce931c529.poster.avif?t=1774324615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/f1a1024310ffbdd0709c151ce931c529.webm?t=1774324615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/f1a1024310ffbdd0709c151ce931c529.mp4?t=1774324615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate twisted, unpredictable versions of familiar games\u2014chess pieces that shoots, snakes and ladders that shift beneath your feet, dominoes that explode on impact\u2014and discover that nothing is as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn luck into strategy as you fight your way across ever-changing boards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/4931ed5377d954d52c7e1b851a464eb6.poster.avif?t=1774324615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/4931ed5377d954d52c7e1b851a464eb6.webm?t=1774324615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/extras/4931ed5377d954d52c7e1b851a464eb6.mp4?t=1774324615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every roll reshapes the board, turning familiar landscapes into chaotic arenas brimming with danger.<br>Traps, hazards, and deadly game pieces emerge from every corner, keeping you on edge and testing your skill, strategy, and luck.<br><br><strong>The rules are gone, and the stakes are higher than ever.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077330?t=1774324615","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077330?t=1774324615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/e20575c0c28a4dea78e65c7e0e53bc04579ca99e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774324615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077330/e20575c0c28a4dea78e65c7e0e53bc04579ca99e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774324615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"